# 🎪 Event Hub

A fast, lightweight event showcase app built with **Express**, **TypeScript**, and **Nunjucks**.

---

## ⚡ Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies
npm install express nunjucks chokidar
npm install -D typescript tsx @types/node @types/express @types/nunjucks copyfiles

# 2. Run dev server (with hot-reloading)
npm run dev